; presets/novice.eval — the party as the game actually starts you.
;
; Included, not hardcoded: a preset is a script fragment so it stays editable,
; diffable and composable like the rest of the suite.
;
; This one deliberately sets almost nothing. A fresh roster IS the novice tier,
; and writing out its numbers here would create a second definition of "starting
; party" that drifts from CreateDefaultParty the first time that changes. The
; file exists so a rung can SAY which tier it meant.

echo preset novice: a fresh roster, bare hands
